## Pulse Agent VM Arguments
## This file is used by the release script to configure the Erlang VM

## Name of the node
-name pulse_agent@127.0.0.1

## Cookie for distributed Erlang
-setcookie pulse_agent_cookie

## Enable kernel polling (Linux only)
+kernel poll true

## Enable SMP support
+smp auto

## Set maximum number of processes
+P 1048576

## Set maximum number of ETS tables
+e 1048576

## Enable dirty CPU schedulers
+sdcpu auto

## Enable dirty IO schedulers
+sdio auto

## Disable CPU topology detection
+c false

## Set maximum heap size for processes (in words)
+hms 50000000

## Enable trace for garbage collection
+t gc

## Logger configuration
-lager handlers [lager_console_backend] crash_log
-lager crash_log_size 10485760
-lager crash_log_msg "{time} [{severity}] {module}:{line} - {message}\n"
-lager crash_log_date "$D0"
-lager crash_log_count 5

## Enable error logger
-error_logger lager